    "identity": {
      "body": "Desert roles favor stillsuits, reclamation seals and appropriate weapons while avoiding shields on the sand. Group strength and available equipment affect which roles appear in an encounter."
    },
    "overview": {
      "body": "Fremen settlements form the local society of the Arrakis campaign. Their groups include traders and ordinary fighters as well as scouts, Fedaykin and naibs."
    },
    "waterDiscipline": {
      "body": "Collectors, sealed clothing, irrigation and reclamation support daily life. A colony’s water reserve has to cover people, animals and production, making waste a practical threat to everyone who depends on the stores."
    }
  },
